@Gateway.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:7000

### Health
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Login
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "catalog-admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### List products (public)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/products

### Create product (admin)
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic wireless mouse",
  "sku": "MOUSE-001",
  "price": 29.99,
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "isActive": true
}
